ius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#047857;background:#d1fae5;\">อนุมัติแล้ว</span><div style=\"margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;\">Planner<br>2 ม.ค. 2569 07:00 น.</div></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#b45309;background:#fef3c7;\">รออนุมัติ</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;\"><tr><td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#b91c1c;\"><a href=\"https://app.example.test/project/project%20golden\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">เปิดดูโครงการ</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;word-break:break-all;\">หรือเปิดลิงก์: <a href=\"https://app.example.test/project/project%20golden\" style=\"color:#2563eb;\">https://app.example.test/project/project%20golden</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px;background:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;\">อีเมลนี้ส่งอัตโนมัติจากระบบ Fiber Sharing กรุณาอย่าตอบกลับ</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
